{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>搭紅眼機快閃東京，落飛第一時間去哪𥚃好？這次挑戰極限16小時玩轉東京，清晨抵達羽田機場即到築地吃超肥美拖羅，再直踩原宿的錢湯浸浴消除疲勞，緊接到澀谷瘋狂掃貨、到銀座吃拉麵、到日本橋買Pokémon手信，逛累了便歎杯抹茶吃件Cafe，時間短都可以玩得超充實！\n</p>\n<p>🩵 留言「tokyo」send完整行程給你～</p>\n<p>達人帶路 ｜ 旅遊唔想做功課？跟住我哋出發就啱！由各路旅遊達人帶你玩轉世界角落，全方位為你搜羅最新最熱門旅遊情報。如果你都想同大家開心Share，就即刻DM我哋啦！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179282166504776437_7569373506adc49a1ac2be.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179282166504776437_7569373506adc49a1ac2be.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：@eatwithmarcosir)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/De3OZV7vGWv/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%b1%e4%ba%ac%e5%bf%ab%e9%96%83/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">東京快閃</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%b1%e4%ba%ac%e8%87%aa%e7%94%b1%e8%a1%8c/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">東京自由行</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%b1%e4%ba%ac%e8%a1%8c%e7%a8%8b/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">東京行程</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：@eatwithmarcosir資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/De3OZV7vGWv/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nOct 24 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T06:21:21.558903+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":400,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip"